    CARINA @ smile "{i}흥미롭군.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/BeneathTheShadows/scr_BeneathTheShadows.rpy:71
translate kr qst_beneath_shadows_enter_bordello_meet_carina_e9ca6df0:

    # CARINA @ talk "I am Carina Calworth, the owner of this establishment and a few more."
    CARINA @ talk "저는 카리나 칼워스입니다, 이곳과 몇 군데 더의 소유주죠."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/BeneathTheShadows/scr_BeneathTheShadows.rpy:75
translate kr qst_beneath_shadows_enter_bordello_meet_carina_673f5e40:

    # CARINA @ talk "Though, I was far more famous when I was... {i}Working.{/i}"
    CARINA @ talk "하지만, 제가... {i}일할 때{/i}가 훨씬 더 유명했죠."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/BeneathTheShadows/scr_BeneathTheShadows.rpy:76
translate kr qst_beneath_shadows_enter_bordello_meet_carina_5d7883e1:

    # "The more I think about the name, the more familiar it seems."
    "그 이름에 대해 생각할수록, 점점 더 낯익게 느껴졌다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/BeneathTheShadows/scr_BeneathTheShadows.rpy:77
translate kr qst_beneath_shadows_enter_bordello_meet_carina_3c548893:

    # MC @ surprised "...You were the courtesan in Lord Halchek's scandal!"
    MC @ surprised "...당신이 할체크 경 스캔들의 그 창녀였군요!"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/BeneathTheShadows/scr_BeneathTheShadows.rpy:78
translate kr qst_beneath_shadows_enter_bordello_meet_carina_3227fc26:

    # "A scandal that rocked all of Alderay just a few years ago, Lord Halchek, handsome, young and married to his beautiful wife, seemed like the perfect couple."
    "불과 몇 년 전 알더레이 전체를 뒤흔든 스캔들, 핸섬하고 젊으며 아름다운 아내와 결혼한 할체크 경은 완벽한 커플처럼 보였다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/BeneathTheShadows/scr_BeneathTheShadows.rpy:79
translate kr qst_beneath_shadows_enter_bordello_meet_carina_0b3a9aa0:

    # "Romantic tales were often spun about him and his wife, and the promise of a {i}new,{/i} young aristocracy not embroiled in the corruption of old."
    "그와 그의 아내에 대한 로맨틱한 이야기들이 자주 만들어졌고, 옛 부패에 휩싸이지 않은 {i}새로운{/i} 젊은 귀족층의 약속이 있었다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/BeneathTheShadows/scr_BeneathTheShadows.rpy:80
translate kr qst_beneath_shadows_enter_bordello_meet_carina_9cef3c0c:

    # "...That was until he was caught red-handed in the bed chamber of Carina Calworth's embrace."
    "...그가 카리나 칼워스의 품에 안긴 침실에서 현장을 발각당하기 전까지는 말이다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/BeneathTheShadows/scr_BeneathTheShadows.rpy:81
translate kr qst_beneath_shadows_enter_bordello_meet_carina_adff000b:

    # CARINA @ talk "I must admit... Of all my dalliances and affairs, I'm always disappointed when people mention that one."
    CARINA @ talk "인정해야겠군요... 제 모든 연애와 불륜 중에서, 사람들이 그걸 언급할 때마다 항상 실망스러워요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/BeneathTheShadows/scr_BeneathTheShadows.rpy:82
translate kr qst_beneath_shadows_enter_bordello_meet_carina_404a5067:

    # CARINA @ smile "I used to tend to the most powerful of diplomats and lords... Foreign kings willing to pay forty-thousand coins a night for me."
    CARINA @ smile "저는 가장 강력한 외교관들과 귀족들을 상대하곤 했죠... 하룻밤에 4만 골드를 내겠다는 외국 왕들도 있었고요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/BeneathTheShadows/scr_BeneathTheShadows.rpy:83
translate kr qst_beneath_shadows_enter_bordello_meet_carina_6893b288:

    # "Carina's eyes seem almost starry as she thinks back nostalgically on that time."
    "카리나의 눈은 그 시절을 향수 어리게 회상하며 거의 별빛처럼 반짝이는 듯했다."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/BeneathTheShadows/scr_BeneathTheShadows.rpy:84
translate kr qst_beneath_shadows_enter_bordello_meet_carina_29b4dfa1:

    # CARINA @ talk "But no, my clumsy 'fun' with Lord Halchek is the one they remember."
    CARINA @ talk "하지만 아니죠, 할체크 경과의 서투른 '장난'이 사람들이 기억하는 거예요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/BeneathTheShadows/scr_BeneathTheShadows.rpy:85
translate kr qst_beneath_shadows_enter_bordello_meet_carina_564b167b:

    # CARINA @ smile "I can assure you, I've brought {i}far{/i} better men to their knees."
    CARINA @ smile "장담하건대, 저는 {i}훨씬{/i} 더 나은 남자들을 무릎 꿇게 했어요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/BeneathTheShadows/scr_BeneathTheShadows.rpy:90
translate kr qst_beneath_shadows_enter_bordello_meet_carina_34a15f80:

    # MC @ think "...I wasn't brought here for you to reminisce, I take it."
    MC @ think "...당신이 추억에 잠기라고 나를 여기 부른 건 아니겠죠."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/BeneathTheShadows/scr_BeneathTheShadows.rpy:91
translate kr qst_beneath_shadows_enter_bordello_meet_carina_a8f58139:

    # CARINA @ smile "Fine, business it is then."
    CARINA @ smile "좋아요, 그럼 일 얘기로 하죠."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/BeneathTheShadows/scr_BeneathTheShadows.rpy:92
translate kr qst_beneath_shadows_enter_bordello_meet_carina_0aae20ad:

    # CARINA @ talk "As I'm sure you're aware, Novaras is a complicated place."
    CARINA @ talk "당신도 알고 있겠지만, 노바라스는 복잡한 곳이에요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/BeneathTheShadows/scr_BeneathTheShadows.rpy:93
translate kr qst_beneath_shadows_enter_bordello_meet_carina_a0bee5bb:

    # CARINA @ talk "So many wolves in the same den... All vying to take control."
    CARINA @ talk "같은 굴에 너무 많은 늑대들이... 모두 통제권을 쥐려고 경쟁하고 있죠."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/BeneathTheShadows/scr_BeneathTheShadows.rpy:94
translate kr qst_beneath_shadows_enter_bordello_meet_carina_025373f3:

    # CARINA @ talk "All too quickly devoured by the others once they sense a moment's weakness."
    CARINA @ talk "다른 이들이 약점의 순간을 감지하면 너무나 빨리 집어삼켜지죠."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/BeneathTheShadows/scr_BeneathTheShadows.rpy:95
translate kr qst_beneath_shadows_enter_bordello_meet_carina_11e71362:

    # MC @ talk "And that's what you are?"
    MC @ talk "그리고 당신이 그렇다는 거예요?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/BeneathTheShadows/scr_BeneathTheShadows.rpy:96
translate kr qst_beneath_shadows_enter_bordello_meet_carina_82b13d1b:

    # MC @ think "One of these wolves you speak of?"
    MC @ think "당신이 말하는 늑대들 중 하나라고요?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/BeneathTheShadows/scr_BeneathTheShadows.rpy:97
translate kr qst_beneath_shadows_enter_bordello_meet_carina_899c34da:

    # CARINA @ talk "Of a sort... I know my place in the den, and I'm happy to continue {i}keeping{/i} it as is."
    CARINA @ talk "어느 정도는... 저는 굴 속 제 자리를 알고 있고, 그 상태 그대로 {i}유지하는{/i} 것에 만족해요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/BeneathTheShadows/scr_BeneathTheShadows.rpy:98
translate kr qst_beneath_shadows_enter_bordello_meet_carina_0873a34f:

    # MC @ serious "I still fail to see what this has to do with me."
    MC @ serious "이게 저랑 무슨 상관인지 아직 모르겠군요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/BeneathTheShadows/scr_BeneathTheShadows.rpy:99
translate kr qst_beneath_shadows_enter_bordello_meet_carina_3343c5fa:

    # CARINA @ talk "It's quite simple, Captain Nyx and I have an... {i}arrangement.{/i}"
    CARINA @ talk "아주 간단해요, 닉스 대장과 저는... {i}합의가{/i} 있어요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/BeneathTheShadows/scr_BeneathTheShadows.rpy:100
translate kr qst_beneath_shadows_enter_bordello_meet_carina_cf19f942:

    # CARINA @ talk "She ignores some of the businesses, and I supply her with the necessary information about the real goings on of the city."
    CARINA @ talk "그녀는 일부 사업을 눈감아 주고, 저는 그녀에게 도시의 진짜 상황에 대한 필요한 정보를 제공해요."

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/BeneathTheShadows/scr_BeneathTheShadows.rpy:101
translate kr qst_beneath_shadows_enter_bordello_meet_carina_2fc732a7:

    # MC @ serious "And you're telling me this because...?"
    MC @ serious "그리고 그걸 저에게 말하는 이유는...?"

# game/data/world_quests/side/novaras/BeneathTheShadows/scr_BeneathTheShadows.rpy:102
translate kr qst_beneath_shadows_enter_bordello_meet_carina_e01f936c:

    # CARINA @ smile "It's simple; sometimes, I ask the good captain to do a few favors for me."
    CARINA @ smile "간단해요; 가끔, 제가 그 친절한 대장님께 부탁 몇 가지를 해요."

